Id: dns008f
Severity: FAIL
Category: network
Check: check_dns
Fix: Allow localhost and the local networks only.
References: PowerDNS settings (allow-from, incoming.allow_from)
Controls: CIS 4.8; NIST SC-5, SC-7; ISO 8.20; CE Firewalls

PowerDNS answers recursion to anyone: allow-from in the recursor
(incoming.allow_from in its recursor.yml), or allow-recursion in an
authoritative server older than 4.1 that recurses through
recursor=, holds 0.0.0.0/0 or ::/0. An open resolver serves the whole Internet, including
spoofed queries that turn it into an amplifier for denial-of-
service attacks against others.
